{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Welcome_to_Wyshbound_with_Logo.png?t=1744143814\" /> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Ouch!.gif?t=1744143814\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/We_Could_Use_Your_Help.png?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WyshBound is an action-adventure RPG across a realm of eccentric kingdoms. Meet companions equipped with unique abilities, solve challenging puzzles, and collect powerful flowers to defeat the villainous Fangor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Meet_the_Companions.png?t=1744143814\" />In WyshBound, companions are key. Each member of your party has a unique set of abilities, which you'll need to surpass obstacles, defeat enemies, and solve puzzles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Turtle_Shorter.gif?t=1744143814\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Companions are found throughout the game, so there's always a new friend to meet and a new ability to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/pandora_right_Border.gif?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Puzzles_to_Solve.png?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WyshBound is no simple stroll from room to room. Puzzles are interspersed across the world, calling back to the nostalgic design of classic action-adventure games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Bush_Burn_Border.gif?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Hand_Drawn_Animation.png?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character is personally crafted and drawn frame-by-frame, giving them all a unique personality. Just look at that mustache bounce!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Town_Hall_Border.gif?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Engaging_Combat.png?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each enemy type is designed to stand out with a personal moveset, making every encounter different from the last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Carrot_boss_Border.gif?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Hitting_Border.gif?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you've read this far, why not try the game out for yourself? Our demo covers a portion of our first chapter, where you will meet your companions Eva and Pandora, and maybe a few hostile vegetables along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3171520?t=1744143814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744143814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/eb8773115466549767e8bb0efdd914f003e69f5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744143814","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/eb8773115466549767e8bb0efdd914f003e69f5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744143814","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Welcome_to_Wyshbound_with_Logo.png?t=1744143814\" /> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Ouch!.gif?t=1744143814\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/We_Could_Use_Your_Help.png?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WyshBound is an action-adventure RPG across a realm of eccentric kingdoms. Meet companions equipped with unique abilities, solve challenging puzzles, and collect powerful flowers to defeat the villainous Fangor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Meet_the_Companions.png?t=1744143814\" />In WyshBound, companions are key. Each member of your party has a unique set of abilities, which you'll need to surpass obstacles, defeat enemies, and solve puzzles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Turtle_Shorter.gif?t=1744143814\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Companions are found throughout the game, so there's always a new friend to meet and a new ability to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/pandora_right_Border.gif?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Puzzles_to_Solve.png?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WyshBound is no simple stroll from room to room. Puzzles are interspersed across the world, calling back to the nostalgic design of classic action-adventure games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Bush_Burn_Border.gif?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Hand_Drawn_Animation.png?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character is personally crafted and drawn frame-by-frame, giving them all a unique personality. Just look at that mustache bounce!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Town_Hall_Border.gif?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Engaging_Combat.png?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each enemy type is designed to stand out with a personal moveset, making every encounter different from the last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Carrot_boss_Border.gif?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/extras/Hitting_Border.gif?t=1744143814\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you've read this far, why not try the game out for yourself? Our demo covers a portion of our first chapter, where you will meet your companions Eva and Pandora, and maybe a few hostile vegetables along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Knights of the Island"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171520/header.jpg?t=1744143814","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.13 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 9 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 470<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p, 16:9 recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS 10.13 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 9 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 570</li></ul>"},"name":"WyshBound","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E5200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 9800GTX+ (1GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 9 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 1080p, 16:9 recommended</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=